ological abnormalities", "Inflammatory vasculitis: possible but lower-tier due to lack of specific serological findings"], "alarm_features": ["Fever", "Unintentional weight loss", "Night sweats", "Pancytopenia with blasts", "Acute neurological symptoms"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.397134670487106, "posterior": 0.06276139362854598, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Constitutional symptoms and high blast count are more characteristic of myeloid neoplasms than plasma cell disorders like multiple myeloma."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm (chronic/accelerated phase)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.28366762177650434, "posterior": 0.5583272074208719, "danger": 0.7, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": ["These findings argue against typical chronic phase CML/MPN presentations, which usually have more gradual symptom development."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["chronic myeloid leukemia", "polycythemia vera", "essential thrombocythemia", "primary myelofibrosis"]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, 